# Merge behaviour for the files several agents touch at once.
#
# With parallel agents the conflicts are almost never in code. Across the three open PRs on
# 6 Nov every collision but two was in these files, so they are the bottleneck, not the work.

# Append-only logs: concurrent entries are additive, so keep both sides instead of conflicting.
# Union can still interleave entries under one heading — read the result before releasing.
CHANGELOG.md    merge=union

# Generated from arch/architecture.json by `archwhere doc`. Never merge it: regenerate it.
# Marked as generated so reviews collapse it and diffs stop drowning the real change.
ARCHITECTURE.md linguist-generated=true

# Keep line endings stable so a Windows checkout does not manufacture whole-file conflicts.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
